reconstruction and limiter, inviscid/viscous fluxes, implicit method, boundary
conditions, METIS/ParMETIS partitioning, and neighbor-only halo exchanges used
by the solver. State the nondimensional references and exact build/run
commands. The generated manifest records the command, rank count, wall time,
and completion status for each actual run.

