\section{Interpretation}
Discuss the residual and force histories, NACA symmetry at zero angle of
attack, viscous-wall behavior, cylinder drag, and (where present) Re 200 vortex
shedding. Explain rank-count consistency using the automatically generated
comparison table. Do not describe a case as successful if its generated
sanity status is failed.
